NtLockFile takes and releases a lock when the caller passes an IO_STATUS_BLOCK.

NtLockFile returned STATUS_NOT_IMPLEMENTED whenever its IO_STATUS_BLOCK
argument was not NULL. Wine's own LockFileEx passes NULL, so nothing in Wine
noticed, but Zig's standard library calls NtLockFile directly with a status
block for every file lock (std.os.windows.LockFile; no event, no APC, no
key). Zig's compiler locks each cache manifest that way, so `zig cc` (Zig
0.17) stopped on its first file with "checking cache failed: manifest_create
Unexpected", wherever its cache was, and a program that builds code with a
bundled Zig could not build anything.

The status block is now filled when the lock is taken or refused (Status is
the returned status, Information 0), as NtUnlockFile already does. An APC
routine or a key is still not implemented and still returns
STATUS_NOT_IMPLEMENTED. The asynchronous wait (an overlapped handle that has
to wait) is unchanged and leaves the block alone.

Checked on an Apple M6, macOS 27.2.1, on 2026-11-25, with
tests/ntlockfile/ntlockfile.c (exclusive, waiting and shared locks through a
status block, and a second handle refused while the first holds the range)
and with Zig 0.17.0's `zig cc -c`, its cache on APFS and on exFAT. The engine
engine-wine-11.0-20261030T202616Z-primer-build fails both (c0000002 at the
first lock); the same engine with this ntdll.so passes both. An ntdll.so
built from this tree without the patch fails the test as the shipped one
does. Upstream: master still has the stub (checked at 274fcfa9,
2026-11-25); not sent.

--- a/dlls/ntdll/unix/file.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/unix/file.c
@@ -6949,7 +6949,9 @@
     HANDLE handle;
     BOOLEAN async;
 
-    if (apc || io_status || key)
+    /* An IO_STATUS_BLOCK is filled once the lock is taken or refused, as NtUnlockFile does;
+     * Zig's standard library passes one with every lock. APCs and keys are still not supported. */
+    if (apc || key)
     {
         FIXME("Unimplemented yet parameter\n");
         return STATUS_NOT_IMPLEMENTED;
@@ -6973,6 +6975,11 @@
         if (ret != STATUS_PENDING)
         {
             if (!ret && event) NtSetEvent( event, NULL );
+            if (io_status)
+            {
+                io_status->Status = ret;
+                io_status->Information = 0;
+            }
             return ret;
         }
         if (async)
